OL,3,GNEWSAAnger over 'lack of clarity' on
OL,4,Aclosed footpath
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP is calling for the reopening of a
OL,7,Ffootpath that has been shut for nearly
OL,8,Fthree years because of damage.
OL,10,FThe pedestrian and cycle "greenway"
OL,11,Froute, linking Radcliffe-on-Trent to
OL,12,FCotgrave in Nottinghamshire, closed in
OL,13,FJanuary 2024 after unauthorised work
OL,14,Fdestabilised an embankment.
OL,16,FJames Naish, the Labour representative
OL,17,Ffor Rushcliffe, delivered a
OL,18,F2,600-strong petition to
OL,19,FNottinghamshire County Council on
OL,20,FSaturday demanding the route be
OL,21,Freinstated.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
