OL,3,GNEWSAAnger over 'lack of clarity' on
OL,4,Aclosed footpath
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said it was looking at
OL,7,Fways of restoring the path, adding that
OL,8,Fthis was subject to ongoing legal
OL,9,Fmatters.
